# PROVENANCE: Synthetic cross-binding regression for finite random replay.
name: replay random exhaustion is non-consuming and non-sticky
case-id: replay-random-exhaustion
origin: synthetic
feature-version: 6
source: generated replay-source regression
requires: iso7816-auth
uid: 04223344556677
picc-generation: EV3
picc-storage: 4096
picc-key-settings-1: 0F
picc-key-settings-2: 01
picc-auth-mode: AES
